; The one variable: `expand_icon = true` on a Button whose box leaves the icon no room (the icon's width
; is negative), at `vertical_icon_alignment` TOP. The icon draws nothing but its negative size still
; leaves the text box (button.cpp:349-405), so the text sits two pixels higher. unit-button-icon-gradienttexture
; draws an icon that fits, where the reservation is positive.

